  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Special - Future of Learning Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this grant is to enable Street Capital to establish a special investment fund, the Future of Learning Fund, that will provide early-stage capital and strategic support to new models of education and learning with ultimate goal of improved learning and employment outcomes.</narrative>
